message.content:
**EXECUTE NOW. Write 9 files. No planning replies.**

Build 9 universal product-page components for InkOS marketing site at `/Users/yashbaldha/Desktop/Boldteq App/Marketing Site/InkOS/`. These power deep-dive product feature pages.

## Reference (read these first for exact visual patterns)
The user provided 3 reference JSX files showing the EXACT design. They're at:
- `/Users/yashbaldha/Downloads/InkOSDossierV3.jsx` — DO NOT use (different palette)
- The actual references (Today/Inbox/Calendar pages) were shared in conversation. The patterns to replicate:

Pattern set is consistent across all 3 source pages — port these patterns into 9 generic components. Read these for additional pattern context:
- `src/components/home/work.tsx` (MoatCard pattern)
- `src/components/home/proof.tsx` (testimonial card pattern)
- `src/components/home/migration.tsx` (comparison table top-strip)
- `src/components/shared/section-eyebrow.tsx`

## Project context
- Next.js 16.2.3, TypeScript strict, Framer Motion, Tailwind v4
- Brand at `@/lib/brand` (BRAND, FONT, SHADOW, GRADIENT, fadeUp, stagger)
- All components are `"use client"` (use motion + interactivity)
- Strict types — zero `any`. `as React.CSSProperties` on inline styles.

## FILE 1: `src/components/product/product-breadcrumb.tsx`

`"use client"`. Simple breadcrumb: `InkOS / Product / [feature]`.

```typescript
interface ProductBreadcrumbProps {
  feature: string;  // e.g. "Today", "Calendar"
}
```

Render as flex row, gap 12. Three spans:
- "InkOS" — FONT.sans 11px 600 stoneTint, letterSpacing 0.18em uppercase, textDecoration none on `<a href="/">`
- "/" separator — stoneLight 11px
- "Product" — same style, link to `/product`
- "/" separator
- feature name — FONT.sans 11px 700 onyx (final, not link)

Container marginBottom 28. motion.div initial { opacity: 0, y: 8 } animate { opacity: 1, y: 0 } transition { duration: 0.6 }.

## FILE 2: `src/components/product/product-hero.tsx`

`"use client"`. The full hero: breadcrumb + headline + italic + subhead + 2 CTAs + dashboard slot.

```typescript
interface ProductHeroProps {
  feature: string;          // for breadcrumb
  headline: string;         // e.g. "Today, in thirty seconds."
  italicWord: string;       // e.g. "in thirty seconds"
  subhead: string;
  primaryCTA?: { label: string; href: string };
  secondaryCTA?: { label: string; href: string };
  dashboard: React.ReactNode;  // slot for the dashboard mockup component
}
```

Defaults: primaryCTA = { label: "Start free trial", href: "https://inkos.up.railway.app/signup" }; secondaryCTA = { label: "See it in motion", href: "/book-a-demo" }.

Section: BRAND.bone bg, position relative, overflow hidden, paddingTop 140, paddingBottom 80.

Background grid texture: `position: absolute, inset: 0, opacity: 0.4, pointerEvents: 'none', backgroundImage: \`linear-gradient(\${BRAND.border} 1px, transparent 1px), linear-gradient(90deg, \${BRAND.border} 1px, transparent 1px)\`, backgroundSize: '80px 80px', maskImage: 'radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 30%, black 30%, transparent 70%)'`.

Container: maxWidth 1280, margin 0 auto, padding 0 32px, position relative.

Inside container:
1. ProductBreadcrumb component
2. Wrapper maxWidth 920:
   - motion.h1: FONT.serif clamp(56px, 8vw, 112px) lineHeight 0.95 letterSpacing -0.03em onyx weight 400 marginBottom 28. headline split: text before italicWord + `<span style={{ fontStyle: 'italic', color: BRAND.rust }}>{italicWord}</span>` + text after.
   - motion.p subhead: FONT.sans 19px lineHeight 1.55 stoneDark maxWidth 720 marginBottom 36
   - CTA row (flex gap 14): primary = onyx pill bone text + ArrowRight + boxShadow; secondary = bordered + ArrowUpRight icon
3. motion.div with marginTop 80 wrapping the `dashboard` slot. animate from opacity:0 y:40 to 1/0 with delay 0.4 ease [0.22,1,0.36,1].

## FILE 3: `src/components/product/product-pillars.tsx`

`"use client"`.

```typescript
import type { LucideIcon } from "lucide-react";

export interface Pillar {
  icon: LucideIcon;
  accent: string;   // hex color, e.g. BRAND.rust
  eyebrow: string;
  title: string;
  desc: string;
  bullets: string[];
}

interface ProductPillarsProps {
  eyebrow: string;       // section eyebrow e.g. "The premise"
  heading: string;       // section heading
  italicWord?: string;   // italic accent in heading
  intro: string;         // paragraph below heading
  pillars: Pillar[];     // 3 cards
}
```

Section: BRAND.boneCream bg, paddingTop 120 paddingBottom 120, borderTop 1px BRAND.border.

Container maxWidth 1280 margin auto padding 0 32px.

motion.div with stagger variants wrapping:
- Header (motion.div fadeUp, marginBottom 64 maxWidth 720):
  - eyebrow div: FONT.sans 11px 700 letterSpacing 0.2em uppercase stoneDark marginBottom 16
  - h2: FONT.serif clamp(38px, 5vw, 60px) lineHeight 1.05 letterSpacing -0.02em onyx 400 marginBottom 18 — italic part inside
  - p: FONT.sans 16px lineHeight 1.6 stoneDark
- Grid: 3-col gap 24 className `td-pillars-grid`. Each pillar = motion.div fadeUp:
  - White bg, 1px border, borderRadius 16, padding 28 26, flex column
  - Icon square: 44x44, accent+'14' bg, accent+'30' border, radius 12, marginBottom 22
  - eyebrow: 10.5px 700 letterSpacing 0.18em uppercase accent color marginBottom 10
  - title: FONT.serif 26px lineHeight 1.15 onyx letterSpacing -0.01em 400 marginBottom 14
  - desc: FONT.sans 13.5px lineHeight 1.6 stoneDark marginBottom 22 flex 1
  - bullets ul: list-style none gap 8, borderTop 1px borderSoft paddingTop 18. Each li flex gap 9 with CheckCircle2 13px onyx + bullet text 12.5px stoneDark lineHeight 1.5

## FILE 4: `src/components/product/product-anatomy.tsx`

`"use client"`. Dashboard with overlaid numbered callouts + side list.

```typescript
export interface AnatomyCallout {
  n: number;
  title: string;
  desc: string;
  position: { top: string; left: string };  // e.g. { top: '15%', left: '34%' }
}

interface ProductAnatomyProps {
  eyebrow: string;
  heading: string;
  italicWord?: string;
  intro: string;
  dashboard: React.ReactNode;  // dashboard mockup
  callouts: AnatomyCallout[];  // typically 5
}
```

Section: BRAND.bone bg, paddingTop 120 paddingBottom 120, borderTop BRAND.border.

Container maxWidth 1280 margin auto padding 0 32px.

Header marginBottom 56 maxWidth 720 (same eyebrow/h2/p pattern as pillars).

Anatomy grid `1.6fr 1fr` gap 56 alignItems flex-start className `td-anatomy-grid`:

LEFT col (motion.div initial x:-24 opacity:0 in-view to x:0 opacity:1 duration 0.8): position relative.
- Render `dashboard` slot
- Map callouts → absolute positioned dot at top/left from callout.position. Dot = 28x28 circle, BRAND.onyx bg, BRAND.bone text, FONT.sans 13px 700, boxShadow `0 4px 14px rgba(15,15,15,0.35), 0 0 0 4px rgba(247,247,245,0.9)`, pointerEvents none.

RIGHT col: flex column gap 4 paddingTop 16. Each callout = motion.div initial y:14 opacity:0 in-view 0.5s delay i*0.06:
- flex gap 16 padding 18 0, borderTop 1px BRAND.border (none on first)
- Number badge (30x30 onyx bone text 13px 700 round)
- Right block:
  - Title: FONT.serif 22px italic onyx letterSpacing -0.01em marginBottom 4
  - Desc: FONT.sans 14px lineHeight 1.55 stoneDark

## FILE 5: `src/components/product/product-item-types.tsx`

`"use client"`. Dark section, grid of cards with severity badges + italic examples.

```typescript
import type { LucideIcon } from "lucide-react";

export interface ItemType {
  icon: LucideIcon;
  accent: string;
  accentBg?: string;     // optional bg for icon square
  severity?: string;     // e.g. "Urgent", "Today" — small pill
  duration?: string;     // alternative to severity, e.g. "2-8 hr"
  title: string;
  desc: string;
  example: string;       // shown italic w/ left border
}

interface ProductItemTypesProps {
  eyebrow: string;
  heading: string;
  italicWord?: string;
  intro: string;
  items: ItemType[];     // 6-9 cards
  columns?: 3 | 4;       // default 3
}
```

Section: BRAND.onyx bg, BRAND.bone color, paddingTop 120 paddingBottom 120.

Header (marginBottom 56 maxWidth 720): eyebrow stoneLight + h2 bone (italic in rustBright if italicWord) + p stoneLight.

Grid `repeat(${columns}, 1fr)` gap 14 className `td-roles-grid`. Each card = motion.div initial y:24 opacity:0 in-view 0.5s delay (i % columns) * 0.06:
- Wrapper: rgba(247,247,245,0.04) bg, 1px rgba(247,247,245,0.10) border, borderRadius 14, padding 22, flex column gap 12
- Top row flex justify space-between:
  - Icon square 36x36 (item.accentBg or accent+'22' bg, accent+'50' border, radius 9). Icon color = if accent === BRAND.onyx use BRAND.bone else accent.
  - Severity OR duration pill: FONT.sans 9px 700 letterSpacing 0.16em uppercase accent color, accent+'15' bg, 1px accent+'30' border, padding 3px 8px borderRadius 100
- Body div:
  - title: FONT.sans 15px 700 bone marginBottom 6
  - desc: 12.5px lineHeight 1.55 stoneLight marginBottom 12
  - example: FONT.serif italic 13px bone, paddingLeft 11, borderLeft 2px accent (or bone if onyx accent)

## FILE 6: `src/components/product/product-vs-table.tsx`

`"use client"`. 5-col comparison table.

```typescript
export type CellValue = boolean | string;

export interface VsTableRow {
  feature: string;
  values: boolean[];  // length === competitors.length, first is InkOS
}

interface ProductVsTableProps {
  eyebrow: string;
  heading: string;
  italicWord?: string;
  intro?: string;        // optional
  competitors: string[]; // first is InkOS, then 3 others
  rows: VsTableRow[];
  caption?: string;      // small text below table
}
```

Section BRAND.bone, paddingTop 120 paddingBottom 120. Container maxWidth 1100 margin auto padding 0 32px.

Header marginBottom 48 maxWidth 720.

Card: white bg, 1px border, radius 16, overflow hidden.

Header row: grid `1.6fr repeat(${competitors.length}, 1fr)`, BRAND.boneCream bg, borderBottom 1px BRAND.border. First cell "Capability" (16px 24, FONT.sans 11/700 stoneDark letterSpacing 0.14em uppercase). Each competitor: 16/14 padding, textAlign center, FONT.sans 12/700, letterSpacing 0.04em, borderLeft 1px BRAND.border. InkOS column (i === 0) gets boneDeep bg + onyx color. Others: stoneDark color, transparent bg.

Body rows: each row = grid same layout, borderTop 1px borderSoft (none on first row). First cell: 16/24 padding, FONT.sans 13.5/500 onyx (the feature name). Value cells: 16/14 padding, textAlign center, borderLeft 1px borderSoft, flex/center/center. InkOS column: boneDeep bg.

Cell rendering:
- `true` → `<CheckCircle2 size={18} color={ci === 0 ? BRAND.rust : BRAND.success} strokeWidth={2.2} />`
- `false` → `<span style={{ color: BRAND.stoneLight, fontSize: 18 }}>—</span>` (em dash)

Caption below table: marginTop 24, FONT.sans 12 stone center.

## FILE 7: `src/components/product/product-day-in-life.tsx`

`"use client"`. Long-form narrative w/ founder quote.

```typescript
interface DayInLifePerson {
  name: string;
  role: string;        // e.g. "Owner · Sable & Sparrow · Brooklyn"
  gradient: string;    // CSS gradient for avatar
}

interface ProductDayInLifeProps {
  eyebrow: string;     // e.g. "A morning"
  heading: string;     // e.g. "8:47 AM. Sable & Sparrow, Brooklyn."
  italicWord?: string;
  intro: string;       // serif intro paragraph (22px)
  paragraphs: string[];     // 3-4 narrative paragraphs (HTML allowed via React.ReactNode for inline strong/em)
  quote: string;       // pull quote
  person: DayInLifePerson;
}
```

For paragraphs, accept `Array<string | React.ReactNode>` so callers can pass strong/em tags.

Section BRAND.boneCream, paddingTop 140 paddingBottom 140, borderTop BRAND.border. Container maxWidth 920 margin auto.

Header (eyebrow + h2 — h2 supports italicWord just like elsewhere, font clamp 38-64px).

Intro: FONT.serif 22px lineHeight 1.55 onyx marginBottom 28.

Body p's: FONT.sans 16px lineHeight 1.75 stoneDark marginBottom 18. `paragraphs.map((p, i) => <p>{p}</p>)`. Allow ReactNode children.

Quote block: motion.div with borderLeft 3px BRAND.rust paddingLeft 28 marginTop 48:
- Quote text: FONT.serif 28px italic lineHeight 1.3 onyx letterSpacing -0.01em marginBottom 18
- Person row: flex alignItems center gap 14:
  - Avatar 40x40 circle with person.gradient
  - Name: FONT.sans 13/700 onyx
  - Role: FONT.sans 12 stone

## FILE 8: `src/components/product/product-related.tsx`

`"use client"`. 4-card grid linking to other product pages.

```typescript
import type { LucideIcon } from "lucide-react";

export interface RelatedModule {
  icon: LucideIcon;
  label: string;
  desc: string;
  href: string;
  badge?: string;  // optional NEW tag etc.
}

interface ProductRelatedProps {
  eyebrow: string;     // e.g. "One of fifteen"
  heading: string;
  italicWord?: string;
  modules: RelatedModule[];  // typically 4
}
```

Section BRAND.bone, paddingTop 120 paddingBottom 120, borderTop BRAND.border. Container maxWidth 1280 padding 0 32px.

Header marginBottom 48 maxWidth 720.

Grid `repeat(${modules.length}, 1fr)` gap 14 className `td-related-grid`. Each card = motion.a fadeUp:
- White bg, 1px border, radius 14, padding 24 22, flex column gap 14, textDecoration none
- Hover: translateY(-2px), borderColor BRAND.onyx, boxShadow card
- Icon square 38x38 boneDeep bg w/ border, radius 9
- Body flex 1: label 15/700 onyx + optional badge pill (rust on rustSoft) inline + desc 12.5 stoneDark
- Footer: "Explore" link 12/600 onyx with ArrowUpRight 12

## FILE 9: `src/components/product/product-cta.tsx`

`"use client"`. Closing CTA on onyx with rust italic.

```typescript
interface ProductCTAProps {
  headline: string;
  italicWord?: string;
  subhead: string;
  primaryCTA?: { label: string; href: string };
  secondaryCTA?: { label: string; href: string };
}
```

Defaults: primaryCTA `{label:"Start free trial",href:"https://inkos.up.railway.app/signup"}`; secondary `{label:"Book a demo",href:"/book-a-demo"}`.

Section BRAND.onyx color BRAND.bone, paddingTop 120 paddingBottom 120. Container maxWidth 920 textAlign center padding 0 32px.

motion.h2: FONT.serif clamp(48px, 6.5vw, 84px), lineHeight 1, letterSpacing -0.025em, BRAND.bone weight 400 marginBottom 22. italicWord wrapped in italic+rustBright span.

motion.p: FONT.sans 17 lineHeight 1.6 stoneLight maxWidth 580 margin 0 auto 40px.

CTA row (motion.div inline-flex gap 12 wrap justify center):
- Primary `<a>`: bone bg + onyx text pill + ArrowRight 15
- Secondary `<a>`: bone color + 1px rgba(247,247,245,0.2) border + ArrowUpRight 15

## Verification

After all 9 files: `cd "/Users/yashbaldha/Desktop/Boldteq App/Marketing Site/InkOS" && pnpm run type-check`. Report PASS or paste errors.

WRITE THE 9 FILES NOW.

